              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi ko dukwiye kuyikundisha imitima yacu yose, ubwenge bwacu bwose; n’inkomezi zacu zose, kandi tugakunda bagenzi bacu nk’uko twikunda. Ivyo birahambaye kurusha gushikanira Imana ayandi mashikanwa yose n’ibimazi vy’ibikoko.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.33",
